                  "description": {
                    "value": "A powerful globe of searing sunlight explodes in the area, dealing 8d10 fire damage to creatures in the area, plus 8d10 additional vitality damage to undead creatures. Each creature in the area must attempt a Reflex save.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature takes half damage.\nFailure: The creature takes full damage.\nCritical Failure: The creature takes full damage and becomes blinded permanently.\n\nIf the globe overlaps with an area of magical darkness, sunburst attempts to 3 the darkness effect."
                  },
